flowchart TD
 Student[Housing / Dining / Account portals] --> Gate[Shared identity / eligibility / controlled actions]
 Staff[Institution domain consoles] --> Gate
 Gate --> Housing[Allocation / occupancy / contracts]
 Gate --> Dining[Plans / lots / order fulfillment]
 Gate --> Accounts[Assessment / ledger / credit obligations]
 Housing --> Accounts
 Dining --> Accounts
 Housing --> Maintenance[Work orders / facilities]
 Accounts --> Rail[Approved payment adapter]
 Housing --> Legacy[Transitional legacy adapters]
 Dining --> Legacy
 Rail --> Reconcile[Receipts and reconciliation]
 Legacy --> Reconcile
 Reconcile --> Outbox[Canonical audit / outbox / projections]
 Outbox --> Student
 Outbox --> Staff
